# NOTICE

## Origin

This repository is a port of **SocialENS** (https://github.com/NikhilRaikwar/SocialENS),
released under the MIT License. The original copyright notice is preserved verbatim in
[`LICENSE`](./LICENSE).

The port keeps the project's MIT licensing intact and records exactly which parts were
reused and which parts were rewritten in [`ATTRIBUTION.md`](./ATTRIBUTION.md).

## Baseline disclosure

The origin repository was generated from **Scaffold-ETH 2** and inherited its Next.js +
Tailwind CSS + daisyUI application shell. The shell (layout, header/footer, theme handling,
notification surface, global styles) was carried over and adapted; the chain integration,
data layer, wallet plumbing, contracts, and tests in this repository were rewritten for NEAR.

No Scaffold-ETH 2 code outside that generic application shell is part of this repository:
the EVM hooks, contract ABIs, wallet connectors, and the example contract workspace were
removed, not vendored.

## Third-party software

See each workspace manifest for the exact dependency set:

- `web/package.json` — Next.js, React, NEAR Connect, `near-api-js`, `near-social-js`,
  the function-call access key plugin, Tailwind CSS, daisyUI, and UI utilities.
- `demo/package.json` — `near-api-js` for the zero-funds testnet loop and the measurement script.
- `contract/Cargo.toml` — `near-sdk` plus sandbox test dependencies.

All third-party software remains under its own license.
